## New HTML Tags

### Anchor Tag

```html
<a href=""></a>
```

Used to create clickable links.

### Line Break Tag

```html
<br>
```

Used to move content to the next line.

## New Attributes Learned

### href

Specifies where the link should go.

Example:

```html
<a href="https://github.com">
    GitHub
</a>
```

### target="_blank"

Opens the link in a new browser tab.

Example:

```html
<a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank">
    LinkedIn
</a>
```

### mailto

Opens the user's email application.

Example:

```html
<a href="mailto:gowdham.uk@icloud.com">
    Email Me
</a>
```

